       pbmtogo - convert a PBM image into compressed GraphOn graphics


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ppbbmmttooggoo [_p_b_m_f_i_l_e]


DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppbbmmttooggoo  reads  a PBM image as input and produces 2D compressed GraphOn
       graphics as output.

       Be sure to set up your GraphOn with the following modes: 8  bits  /  no
       parity;  obeys  no  XON/XOFF;  NULs are accepted.  These are all on the
       Comm menu.  Also, remember to turn off tty post processing.  Note  that
       there is no gotopbm tool.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       There are no command line options defined specifically for ppbbmmttooggoo, but
       it recognizes the options common to all  programs  based  on  libnetpbm
       (See
        Common Options ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ .)


